{'symbol': 'BG', 'date': '2021-05-12 17:15:00', 'title': 'BUNGE TO PARTICIPATE AT BMO CAPITAL MARKETS FARM TO MARKET CONFERENCE', 'text': 'ST. LOUIS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--BUNGE LIMITED (NYSE:BG) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT GREG HECKMAN, CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER, WILL PARTICIPATE IN A FIRESIDE CHAT AT THE BMO CAPITAL MARKETS 16TH ANNUAL FARM TO MARKET CONFERENCE ON WEDNESDAY, MAY 19, AT 12:40 EDT. THE LINK TO THE WEBCAST WILL BE AVAILABLE ON WWW.BUNGE.COM IN THE “EVENTS AND PRESENTATIONS” SECTION. ABOUT BUNGE AT BUNGE (WWW.BUNGE.COM, NYSE: BG), OUR PURPOSE IS TO CONNECT FARMERS TO CONSUMERS TO DELIVER ESSENTIAL FOOD, FEED AND FUEL TO THE WORLD'}